config MYRON_MCA_READONLY
    tristate "Myron independent read-only MCA telemetry (compile qualification only)"
    depends on OF && SYSFS && POWER_SUPPLY && QTI_PMIC_GLINK
    default n
    help
      Compile an independent opt-in GET-only client with a fixed property
      allowlist and optional read-only USB power_supply reporting. This
      does not enable charging policies or install any module on a device.
